# brainstorm

Run brainstorming before building. Read
`docs/process/start-here.md` for setup/onboarding context and
`docs/process/workflow.md` for the Brainstorm phase.
Ask in rounds: every open decision whose prerequisites are settled,
numbered, each with your recommended answer; look facts up yourself.
{% if modules.speckit %}Derive the tier first; for Tier 2+ run `/speckit-specify` and clarify in
rounds until no `[NEEDS CLARIFICATION]` marker survives
(`docs/process/modules/speckit.md`). Write a spec only after approval.
{% else %}Ask your questions in
rounds, summarize assumptions, name trade-offs, and write the design using
the scaffold in `docs/process/design-template.md` — mark underspecified points
as `[NEEDS CLARIFICATION: <question>]` instead of guessing, and resolve every
marker before approval.
{% endif %}
